# lane of governed round FAR-LANE-SOD-003 (writer=codex, model pin opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash).
# It is NOT accepted, NOT promoted, and NOT active. Nothing in the live Hermes install, the
# canonical policy (config/model-lane-assignment.json), %LOCALAPPDATA%\HG-KSEOS, or the Shared
# Spine has been changed by producing it.
