# adoption source, and revision 9
# (sha256 969af3036aeca8e71ab8281dfe8fb14cf63abcf298d75401c29d984cc974bede) was superseded on
# 2026-10-07 when the orchestrator added the explicit per-lane reasoning_effort declaration at
# the operator's instruction. The superseded pins are recorded under `history:` below and are
# never re-declared as current. The projections[] block
# lists every live file and JSON pointer that must agree with these routes; check_drift() in
