# epoch 11 (2026-10-07): the registry's own publication counter. `epoch` documents this registry's
# route-shape generation, so it must advance whenever the registry's committed content changes.
# TASK8 advanced `source_of_routes` (revision 10 -> 11 plus a new digest) and appended bindings
# WITHOUT advancing `epoch`; epoch 11 records that committed generation and the revision-12
# declaration repair (dual-arm cleanup, provider_separation_status, EXECUTE effort, and the
# projection-drops-dual-arms gap).
# epoch 11 (2026-10-07): repair round 2 — the arm-B exhaustive-declaration repair. Stale NVIDIA-era prose corrected, provider separation recorded as PARTIAL by operator mandate, the route-projection gap declared, the retired-slug occurrences labelled, and the epoch advanced because this file's own content changed.

schema: HGK-LANE-ROUTING-REGISTRY/1
status: CANDIDATE
