  REQ-FAR-LANE-SOD-003 / WO-LANE-ROUTE-001-EXECUTE (writer=codex). The route values are adopted
  from the `sod` block of config/model-lane-assignment.json, dispatchable at revision 13. This
  registry does not itself confer authority; activation requires an HGK-authorized generation
  binding.

